 in Allah, forgiveness, and the power of faith. It provides timeless guidance on overcoming trials, maintaining moral integrity, and understanding divine wisdom.", "short_description": "Surah Yusuf narrates the compelling story of Prophet Yusuf (Joseph), teaching patience, trust in Allah, forgiveness, and the power of faith. It provides timeless guidance on overcoming trials, maintaining moral integrity, and understanding divine wisdom."}]}, "developer_name": "Miracle Group", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://miraclegroup.work/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Miracle Group", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.miraclegroup.work/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "34282164451427980"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823341_1531930202268155_8806785617668924594_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=107&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yq_GLKWLSFAQ7kNvwEGkd_O&_nc_oc=AdojJeZaPOMaqK7jLYNo900OhbQoB5gZWDZWhk_Gm18i99HnJYC69UJrPxjI43ULnM0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT7ZaxYjHVTJHMozUt5u02vCbSJpJw-Pgy6I7UkvTjcfg&oe=6B08456A"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Surah Yus